      "title": "Chemistry 101 Lab Assistant",
      "description": "Dominican University Careers Careers JOIN OUR TEAM Position: Chemistry 101 Lab Assistant Location: River Forest, IL Job Id: 2419 # of Openings: 1 TITLE: CHEM 101 - Introductory General Chemistry Assistant FLSA Status: Hourly REPORTS TO: Lecturer OPEN TO: Undergraduate Students AVAILABLE: Spring 2027 HOURLY RATE: 15.00 Student Lab assistant for the introductory general chemistry lab needed Assist with lab set up and general equipment Supervisor will train Must be eligible for US Employment Must be an undergraduate student at Dominican University Must have passed a general or introductory chemistry class or their equivalent with a grade B or higher. We are currently looking for Tutors. If you meet the previous requirements, apply to be a tutor! Apply for this Position Go back to the job list powered by Dominican University | (708) 366-2490"
